]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 that same pair sat at 63% of normal on the middle, while June to July ran 168%. Grid 25345 had its driest year in 1988, at 50% of normal.</p>"}
